# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Where the Flowers Remember — Vault .gitignore
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Never commit credentials. Covers .env and name.env.
.env
*.env

# ── Session Recordings (voices of real people) ────────────────
Session_Sources/Recordings/
*.mp3

# ── Copyrighted D&D Source PDFs ───────────────────────────────
DND_Sources/*.pdf

# ── Auto-fetched DDB party sheets (other players' data) ───────
# ddb_party_sync.js pulls full character sheets players shared only
# "Campaign Only" on D&D Beyond. Kept local-only by default. If this repo
# stays private and you want them committed, remove these two lines.
03-Characters/01 PCs/Party Character Sheets/_raw/
03-Characters/01 PCs/Party Character Sheets/*(DDB).md

# ── Obsidian / tooling ────────────────────────────────────────
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/cache
.smart-env/
.claude/

# ── Node / OS junk ────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
package-lock.json
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
